client -> gate: Query (web UI / chat UI / API client)
activate gate
gate -> server: Query (auth, rate-limit, telemetry)
activate server
server -> llm: Client Query (system+user prompt + retrieval context)
activate llm
hnote over llm
Preprocessing (language detection, query normalization, intent classification)
end hnote
llm --> server: Preprocessed query (intent + embeddings)
deactivate llm

server -> vdb: Processed Search Query (embedding-based & keyword search; filter by date/jurisdiction)
activate vdb
vdb --> server: Raw response (ranked text chunks + provenance)
deactivate vdb

server -> llm: Raw Response + system prompt (RAG: include citations, answer policy)
activate llm
hnote over llm
Processing for human-like, relevant response, chain-of-thought hidden; produce final answer + citations + confidence score + trace_id
end hnote
llm --> server: Processed response (answer, sources, confidence, follow-ups)
deactivate llm

server --> gate: Processed response (postprocess: format, redaction if needed)
deactivate server
gate --> client: Processed response (UI: answer + “sources” panel + "verify with a lawyer" CTA)
deactivate gate

out -> vdb: New data (watchers/webhooks/feeds ingest changes from FTS, Duma legislation portals, Garant/ConsultantPlus if licensed)
hnote over vdb
adjustments due to changes (re-index, incrementals, update metadata)
end hnote